    "The private session binds original PID, canonical physical root, original authority descriptor and active lifetime; only the exact session type/internal construction token is accepted. Raw dictionaries, foreign owner/root/authority and closed sessions reject before stages.",
    "The five former validation boundaries retain full original verify_barrier hash/epoch/name/ancestor/engine/socket checks and four fresh stock image projections each. Entry/exit failures preserve the original exception with closing-barrier notes.",
    "Materializer, held runtime, executor and cold bodies retain original factory reconstruction, live guardian restrictions, collector stop, original process/container inputs, accepted ingress, resources and complete all-phase reconciliation. Public entrypoints still acquire independent selected inputs before delegation.",
    "Cold provider import now uses the genuine reconciliation helper as separately reviewed by fb47145c; no closure epoch waiver, restoration, historical rebinding or accepted CPU04 result is introduced.",
    "The original CLI owns session lifetime through runtime/two arms/authenticated guardian stop/cold pair result, then closes it. Guardian cleanup remains inside its owned error path; failed timing persistence cannot preempt stop/context cleanup.",
    "Timeline has twelve fixed names, at most24 start/terminal events and16KiB, actual wall and monotonic clocks, null start terminal and honest failed/incomplete fates. Sticky persistence failure keeps pair status failed and original reserve/FD cleanup.",
